  "body": "Currently we allow `fetch(url, { redirect: 'manual' })` which can return an opaque-redirect Response.  This works fine, unless intercepted by a SW that does `e.respondWith(fetch(e.request))`.  Then it breaks because we only allow passing opaque-redirect Responses to respondWith() if the request is a navigation.\n\nWe should consider allowing opaqueredirect for any Request with a \"manual\" RedirectMode.\n",
